@startuml Photo Upload - Simplified
!theme plain
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Repository
database PostgreSQL
database "File System" as FS

User -> Frontend: Upload foto
Frontend -> Controller: POST /photos/upload

== Validatie ==
Controller -> Controller: Check bestand
alt Ongeldig
    Controller --> Frontend: 400 Bad Request
    Frontend --> User: Foutmelding
else Geldig
    Controller -> Service: savePhoto(file)

    == Metadata & Processing ==
    Service -> Service: Extract EXIF metadata
    Service -> Service: RAW detectie

    alt RAW format
        Service -> Service: Probeer preview (3x)
        alt Mislukt
            Service -> Service: Placeholder image
        end
    end

    Service -> Service: Resize & compress\n(max 2560px, JPEG 92%)

    == Opslag ==
    Service -> FS: Opslaan (UUID naam)
    Service -> Repository: Save metadata
    Repository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT photo

    Service --> Controller: Success
    Controller --> Frontend: 200 OK + details
    Frontend --> User: Foto in galerij
end

@enduml

